[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6217871786","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2589#issuecomment-6217871786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2589","id":6217871786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcp0xqg","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:38:12Z","body":"我在本地按 0.1.1273 的代码把\"Windows 导出 → macOS 导入\"全程复现了一遍，结论是：**这是备份的设计行为，不是导入丢数据**。\n\nWorkBuddy 和 Trae CN 在 magpie 里是订阅类（登录制）供应商，它们的\"多个账号\"是登录凭据，不是存在供应商配置里的数据。备份文件**有意不携带任何订阅登录**（这是 #880 当时被关闭时的设计决定）——导出对话框上也写着这句提示：\"Subscriptions aren't in it: sign in to them on the other computer\"（订阅不在备份里：请在另一台电脑上登录）。原因也简单：登录凭据只属于登录它的那台机器，备份带着它就等于直接把账号登录到新机器上。\n\n我构造了 WorkBuddy 2 个账号 + Trae CN 2 个账号 + 一个多 key 自定义供应商的配置，走导出 → 导入全程：\n\n- 两个供应商的**条目**全部导入成功（条目在备份里）；\n- 账号一个都不在备份里（有意为之，含 keys 的导出也一样）；\n- 导入完成后 magpie 会提示哪些订阅需要在这台机器上重新登录，WorkBuddy 和 Trae CN 都会列在里面。\n\n所以在 macOS 上看到的\"其中一个账号\"，应该是这台机器自己登录过（或导入后登录）的那个，不是 Windows 那边带过来的。把其余账号在\"供应商 → WorkBuddy / Trae CN\"里逐个登录即可恢复多账号。\n\n两点向你确认：\n\n1. 如果你说的\"账号\"不是订阅登录，而是手动添加的供应商条目或多把 API key：请说明这几个账号当时是怎么加的，以及导出时是否勾选了\"With the providers' API keys\"（包含供应商 API 密钥）——没勾选的话，自定义供应商的 key 也是有意不随备份走的；\n2. 如果勾选了包含密钥、重新导出导入后，自定义供应商的多把 key 仍然丢失：请贴一下 providers.json 里相关条目的脱敏片段（key 打码），我再往下查。\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6217871786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218312213","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2589#issuecomment-6218312213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2589","id":6218312213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcqPqFQ","user":{"login":"ID404","id":9051024,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTEwMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9051024?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404","html_url":"https://github.com/ID404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ID404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T15:01:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:01:17Z","body":"我明白了，在MacOS上我需要 把其余账号在\"供应商 → WorkBuddy / Trae CN\"里逐个登录。谢谢解答","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218312213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]